(3329716, 463216, 65234, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are lovely, and the expression on the rock''s face is interesting.  I don''t see a connection between the loveliness of the scene and that expression.  Maybe he''s sad because the foals are not playing with him?  It''s just not obvious to me why the disparate elements are in the composition.  But it is pretty.</td>', 'The colors in this are lovely, and the expression on the rock''s face is interesting.  I don''t see a connection between the loveliness of the scene and that expression.  Maybe he''s sad because the foals are not playing with him?  It''s just not obvious to me why the disparate elements are in the composition.  But it is pretty.', '2007-02-05 08:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
