(3330463, 462516, 60183, '<td valign="top">wow, great job!</td>', 'wow, great job!', '2007-02-05 11:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3330466, 463865, 66384, '<td valign="top">Excellent personification. You got it all: humor, face, and emotion. Technically, it could be better: lighting, composition, color. The tan tile doesn''t do anything to enhance the shot and the lines and the bright spot in the upper right are distracting. I think a bright colored backdrop would greatly improved the impact of this shot. And if the can opener was a little more to the right and "looking" a little more toward the can, the composition would be stronger.</td>', 'Excellent personification. You got it all: humor, face, and emotion. Technically, it could be better: lighting, composition, color. The tan tile doesn''t do anything to enhance the shot and the lines and the bright spot in the upper right are distracting. I think a bright colored backdrop would greatly improved the impact of this shot. And if the can opener was a little more to the right and "looking" a little more toward the can, the composition would be stronger.', '2007-02-05 12:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3330467, 463653, 39566, '<td valign="top">nice job, like the bright colors</td>', 'nice job, like the bright colors', '2007-02-05 12:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3330472, 464061, 18403, '<td valign="top">The photo is too dark to see what is happening. My first impression is that the person is asking for coins to feed the pay phone.  Careful scrutiny revealed that it might be the phone itself asking for the change from a passerby.  Idea is good but the image is just too dark!</td>', 'The photo is too dark to see what is happening. My first impression is that the person is asking for coins to feed the pay phone.  Careful scrutiny revealed that it might be the phone itself asking for the change from a passerby.  Idea is good but the image is just too dark!', '2007-02-05 12:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3330476, 461620, 39566, '<td valign="top">nice job!</td>', 'nice job!', '2007-02-05 12:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
