(3331691, 461620, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is just classic!  Had me crying!  It may not be the best photo in the owrld, but it certainly works in terms of humour and of the challenge.  I shall be e-mailing the link to this  to my girl-friends once the challenge is over!</td>', 'This is just classic!  Had me crying!  It may not be the best photo in the owrld, but it certainly works in terms of humour and of the challenge.  I shall be e-mailing the link to this  to my girl-friends once the challenge is over!', '2007-02-05 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3331699, 464003, 39566, '<td valign="top">my eyes keep getting drawn to the big green spot in the right upper corner...maybe a closer crop to the red leafs( I understand that the other leafs are blurry b/c the green leaf is being focused on i''m just talking about that one spot and it''s only my opinion...good luck 7</td>', 'my eyes keep getting drawn to the big green spot in the right upper corner...maybe a closer crop to the red leafs( I understand that the other leafs are blurry b/c the green leaf is being focused on i''m just talking about that one spot and it''s only my opinion...good luck 7', '2007-02-05 16:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
