(3333900, 463998, 66201, '<td valign="top">Oh well done!</td>', 'Oh well done!', '2007-02-06 07:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3333911, 463846, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic: I absolutely love the capture of the face... Just a teeny bit of issue with the B+W conversion: seems a bit grey. I would have loved a tiny bit of a tighter crop and a bit more contrast to lessen the grey of the hands. I''m not a high contrast fan myself, but I think this could have done with a tweek more. Nevertheless 9!</td>', 'This is fantastic: I absolutely love the capture of the face... Just a teeny bit of issue with the B+W conversion: seems a bit grey. I would have loved a tiny bit of a tighter crop and a bit more contrast to lessen the grey of the hands. I''m not a high contrast fan myself, but I think this could have done with a tweek more. Nevertheless 9!', '2007-02-06 07:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3333972, 463637, 31443, '<td valign="top">It made me really sad! Great light!</td>', 'It made me really sad! Great light!', '2007-02-06 08:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334116, 462678, 30049, '<td valign="top">I have to say this image has made me stop, think, and look deeper than many have for this challenge.  It''s one of those photos that if seen outside the context of this challenge I might stop and ponder as well.  Looking, considering, pondering...none of that is helping me to see where the ''Personification'' lies within.  Sorry.  I love the texture and detail in this.  The positioning of the subject within the frame makes for a compelling composition.<br/> <br/>FWIW - I''d keep this location in mind for other subjects as well.  Perhaps something a bit more "earthy"?  This corner makes a great backdrop!<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I have to say this image has made me stop, think, and look deeper than many have for this challenge.  It''s one of those photos that if seen outside the context of this challenge I might stop and ponder as well.  Looking, considering, pondering...none of that is helping me to see where the ''Personification'' lies within.  Sorry.  I love the texture and detail in this.  The positioning of the subject within the frame makes for a compelling composition. FWIW - I''d keep this location in mind for other subjects as well.  Perhaps something a bit more "earthy"?  This corner makes a great backdrop! Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-02-06 09:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334117, 463536, 69448, '<td valign="top">I aint allowed to vote, but my guess and hope is that you will win this challenge. Fabolous scene!</td>', 'I aint allowed to vote, but my guess and hope is that you will win this challenge. Fabolous scene!', '2007-02-06 09:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334133, 463846, 24073, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  My only 10 of the challenge.  Its unique, and its simple, and its very memberable.  Fantastic job.  GL.</td>', 'Brilliant.  My only 10 of the challenge.  Its unique, and its simple, and its very memberable.  Fantastic job.  GL.', '2007-02-06 09:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
