(3334721, 463908, 59029, '<td valign="top">very clever idea and great use of available materials!</td>', 'very clever idea and great use of available materials!', '2007-02-06 12:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334732, 464010, 59029, '<td valign="top">not crazy about the lighting, but a good idea and shot anyway.</td>', 'not crazy about the lighting, but a good idea and shot anyway.', '2007-02-06 12:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334733, 462078, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool photo.  Clean, simple, focused (mostly).  Some issues I think this will run into is the subject is human in form, and was intentionally made (manufactured) that way.  Items such as clothes pins, or lamps (two examples of many), when positioned properly do a better job of meeting what this challenge is about IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very cool photo.  Clean, simple, focused (mostly).  Some issues I think this will run into is the subject is human in form, and was intentionally made (manufactured) that way.  Items such as clothes pins, or lamps (two examples of many), when positioned properly do a better job of meeting what this challenge is about IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-02-06 12:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334740, 463911, 59029, '<td valign="top">good shot, eh? 8</td>', 'good shot, eh? 8', '2007-02-06 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334755, 462431, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  It would have worked a little better technically, if you move the subjects away from the  background more to allow the DOF to blur it out.  Some minor adjustments to this using curves or even a histogram adj would add some zing to this.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is cute.  It would have worked a little better technically, if you move the subjects away from the  background more to allow the DOF to blur it out.  Some minor adjustments to this using curves or even a histogram adj would add some zing to this.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-06 12:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334765, 463323, 63163, '<td valign="top">To dark</td>', 'To dark', '2007-02-06 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
