(3350499, 463958, 47852, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  Took me a few seconds to figure out what this all was, all I could see was the face!  Nice!</td>', 'Very clever.  Took me a few seconds to figure out what this all was, all I could see was the face!  Nice!', '2007-02-10 11:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350503, 463998, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hah!  What a cute setup!  And the title makes it even funnier.  My first thought was a dad shouting at a kid, or a bully spitting on some smaller kid.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Hah!  What a cute setup!  And the title makes it even funnier.  My first thought was a dad shouting at a kid, or a bully spitting on some smaller kid.  Nicely done!', '2007-02-10 11:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350505, 464068, 47852, '<td valign="top">The hand and the angle of the fruit are great together to give this shot feeling.  Seems a little soft though.. might be better if it was sharpened up a tad to really make those prickles stand out!</td>', 'The hand and the angle of the fruit are great together to give this shot feeling.  Seems a little soft though.. might be better if it was sharpened up a tad to really make those prickles stand out!', '2007-02-10 11:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
