(3352514, 463216, 47852, '<td valign="top">I get that he looks sad, but it doesn''t seem to have any interaction with the rest of the shot.  If I was sitting there looking at that pretty landscape with the horses, I don''t think I''d look so sad.</td>', 'I get that he looks sad, but it doesn''t seem to have any interaction with the rest of the shot.  If I was sitting there looking at that pretty landscape with the horses, I don''t think I''d look so sad.', '2007-02-11 08:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3352516, 463757, 47852, '<td valign="top">My goodness, how long did this setup take!?  And to even have their portrait in the frame on the wall.  I hope you at least got to eat the yummy breakfast before getting to work on this shot.  Very creative!</td>', 'My goodness, how long did this setup take!?  And to even have their portrait in the frame on the wall.  I hope you at least got to eat the yummy breakfast before getting to work on this shot.  Very creative!', '2007-02-11 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
