(3352523, 463434, 47852, '<td valign="top">He looks so angry!  I like that you thought to tuck the cord underneath instead of having it trail off to the side like a tail.  I think using a smooth posterboard instead of the wrinkled fabric and a bit more dramatic lighting would have given this one a better score with most voters.</td>', 'He looks so angry!  I like that you thought to tuck the cord underneath instead of having it trail off to the side like a tail.  I think using a smooth posterboard instead of the wrinkled fabric and a bit more dramatic lighting would have given this one a better score with most voters.', '2007-02-11 08:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3352525, 462944, 47852, '<td valign="top">Almost missed the little happy fact on the bottle here... I''n not sure how you could have made it more pronounced though.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Almost missed the little happy fact on the bottle here... I''n not sure how you could have made it more pronounced though.  Nicely done.', '2007-02-11 08:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
