(3353024, 463296, 30861, '<td valign="top">I am sure you will not be doing well with this one, but I''m in love with it. I thin k it''s a wonderful, deadpan-evocative image, hollow and desolate and poignant, and I am giving it a 9. For me this has the essence of "personification", int he sense that the place itself seems freighted with expressed emotion, without you having to use any gimmicky tricks to express it. This is the real thing. Good luck to you!</td>', 'I am sure you will not be doing well with this one, but I''m in love with it. I thin k it''s a wonderful, deadpan-evocative image, hollow and desolate and poignant, and I am giving it a 9. For me this has the essence of "personification", int he sense that the place itself seems freighted with expressed emotion, without you having to use any gimmicky tricks to express it. This is the real thing. Good luck to you!', '2007-02-11 13:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
