(3354520, 463552, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the challenge topic.  Im always glad to see the different creative interpretations.  The challenge description calls for a personification and goes on to say it shows human characteristics or evokes a human feeling.  I hope that definition of personification doesnt cause you to lose points from some of the voters.<br/> <br/>From Websters: Personification = A divinity or imaginary being representing a thing or abstraction.<br/> <br/>I actually do take the time to look up the alternate meanings of challenge topics.  I would hate to drop someones score because of my own ignorance.  <br/> <br/>I really like the soft green coloring to this one and the unusual subject.  A very clean and bold entry.   It takes a great eye to see beauty in the ordinary things.  Well done!  High marks from me.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the challenge topic.  Im always glad to see the different creative interpretations.  The challenge description calls for a personification and goes on to say it shows human characteristics or evokes a human feeling.  I hope that definition of personification doesnt cause you to lose points from some of the voters. From Websters: Personification = A divinity or imaginary being representing a thing or abstraction. I actually do take the time to look up the alternate meanings of challenge topics.  I would hate to drop someones score because of my own ignorance.   I really like the soft green coloring to this one and the unusual subject.  A very clean and bold entry.   It takes a great eye to see beauty in the ordinary things.  Well done!  High marks from me.', '2007-02-11 21:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
