(3354817, 463757, 50641, '<td valign="top">Amazing effort.  Technically good.  But this seems like it''s de-personifying people by making them frying pan heads, rather than personifying objects. You''d get 11/10 points from me in a surreal challenge.  By the way, Mom is eating someone''s eyeballs for breakfast, and I don''t think that post-it notes and a ballpoint pen are a healthy way to start your busy day, no matter how you fry ''em.  Incidentally, you are really bonkers and I appreciate that.</td>', 'Amazing effort.  Technically good.  But this seems like it''s de-personifying people by making them frying pan heads, rather than personifying objects. You''d get 11/10 points from me in a surreal challenge.  By the way, Mom is eating someone''s eyeballs for breakfast, and I don''t think that post-it notes and a ballpoint pen are a healthy way to start your busy day, no matter how you fry ''em.  Incidentally, you are really bonkers and I appreciate that.', '2007-02-11 23:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
