(3355126, 462873, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  This rock is part of the family since my daughter found it near the Royal Gorge last year. She let out a yell when she found it and I thought she was bitten by a rattler or something.<br/> <br/> It kind of makes me wonder how many folks have walked right by this lonely ole rock in the past 300 years or so, and missed the natural expression he has in stone.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-12 00:33:42.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  This rock is part of the family since my daughter found it near the Royal Gorge last year. She let out a yell when she found it and I thought she was bitten by a rattler or something.  It kind of makes me wonder how many folks have walked right by this lonely ole rock in the past 300 years or so, and missed the natural expression he has in stone.', '2007-02-12 00:24:08.000000', '2007-02-12 00:33:42.000000', 0),
