(3355239, 464056, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hey - I gave this a 6 during the challenge.  I love the face!  I saw your re-do - much better!  Tell me tho - are you using a tripod?  Also - use a tripod (minimizes blur), use a lower ISO (reduce noise), and slow down the shutter speed - increase light.  You are getting there woman!</td>', 'Hey - I gave this a 6 during the challenge.  I love the face!  I saw your re-do - much better!  Tell me tho - are you using a tripod?  Also - use a tripod (minimizes blur), use a lower ISO (reduce noise), and slow down the shutter speed - increase light.  You are getting there woman!', '2007-02-12 00:39:33.000000', NULL, 0),
