(3355295, 463924, 57981, '<td valign="top">not much in it though ... 0.01 at the end ... my score plummeted in the last hour.<br/> <br/>but, as my original comment said, this is a great shot. congrats on the top 10 finish! :)</td>', 'not much in it though ... 0.01 at the end ... my score plummeted in the last hour. but, as my original comment said, this is a great shot. congrats on the top 10 finish! :)', '2007-02-12 00:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
