(3355303, 464057, 46663, '<td valign="top">shockingly good shot there mate.  Congrats!</td>', 'shockingly good shot there mate.  Congrats!', '2007-02-12 00:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3355306, 463549, 46663, '<td valign="top">congrats on the PB and honorable mention.  It is a sweet shot.</td>', 'congrats on the PB and honorable mention.  It is a sweet shot.', '2007-02-12 00:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3355308, 463076, 60862, '<td valign="top">Susan, I''m sure you got slammed hard for DNMC.  Had I voted, I would''ve said the same thing.  The challenge was to find something that evokes human traits.  Puppets, stuffed animals, etc. are made with faces, so it doesn''t feel like it fits to me.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, though, the shot is a bit too bright.  The result is that the black lines come out dark gray and the whole thing looks washed out.<br/> <br/>I wouldn''t spend much time on it, though.  I''ve learned to chuckle and just move on. :)</td>', 'Susan, I''m sure you got slammed hard for DNMC.  Had I voted, I would''ve said the same thing.  The challenge was to find something that evokes human traits.  Puppets, stuffed animals, etc. are made with faces, so it doesn''t feel like it fits to me. Aside from that, though, the shot is a bit too bright.  The result is that the black lines come out dark gray and the whole thing looks washed out. I wouldn''t spend much time on it, though.  I''ve learned to chuckle and just move on. :)', '2007-02-12 00:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3355311, 462944, 46663, '<td valign="top">fanatastic shot and finish.  Makes me wonder if Budweiser would be interested in using it in their promo''s.  Congrats on the top ten finish.</td>', 'fanatastic shot and finish.  Makes me wonder if Budweiser would be interested in using it in their promo''s.  Congrats on the top ten finish.', '2007-02-12 00:51:22.000000', NULL, 0),
