(3355338, 463599, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like this. :)  I''m not sure about the title, but when it first opened I thought "ah, someone closing her eyes and basking in the morning sun."<br/> <br/>Oh!  Just got it (I think).  It''s a lamp, talking to the sun, almost like it''s the lamp''s god.  Wow, what a concept - I went deeper than posthumous. ;)</td>', 'I like this. :)  I''m not sure about the title, but when it first opened I thought "ah, someone closing her eyes and basking in the morning sun." Oh!  Just got it (I think).  It''s a lamp, talking to the sun, almost like it''s the lamp''s god.  Wow, what a concept - I went deeper than posthumous. ;)', '2007-02-12 00:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
