(3355438, 463990, 60862, '<td valign="top">This really makes me smile.  Your title really nails it, too.  I think the score suffered because of the funky focus.  I can''t quite figure out why the bit on the right edge is clear, as is part of the pink flower, but not the bulk of the "face."  Too much noise reduction, maybe?</td>', 'This really makes me smile.  Your title really nails it, too.  I think the score suffered because of the funky focus.  I can''t quite figure out why the bit on the right edge is clear, as is part of the pink flower, but not the bulk of the "face."  Too much noise reduction, maybe?', '2007-02-12 01:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
