(3357703, 463990, 40718, '<td valign="top">The technicals:  I''ve entered shots at 60% quality before and they didn''t look like this at all.  Did you use Neat Image?  This has that over-NI''d look to me.  The lighting isn''t bad, but also not dramatic.  You do see some highlighting on the top leaf of cabbage.  Composition is centered and static.<br/> <br/>The feel: It took me a while to see the face in this shot.  The shot does "feel" shy somewhat.<br/> <br/>The game: Personification.  It was a minefield.  People were all over with their interpretations.  I can tell you I gave you a 2, but that was purely because I didn''t see the face until this time around.  Had I revoted, however, it would have been a 4-5.  Mainly the NI look kills the shot.  You didn''t mention the processing, but if you used Neat Image, that''s your culprit.</td>', 'The technicals:  I''ve entered shots at 60% quality before and they didn''t look like this at all.  Did you use Neat Image?  This has that over-NI''d look to me.  The lighting isn''t bad, but also not dramatic.  You do see some highlighting on the top leaf of cabbage.  Composition is centered and static. The feel: It took me a while to see the face in this shot.  The shot does "feel" shy somewhat. The game: Personification.  It was a minefield.  People were all over with their interpretations.  I can tell you I gave you a 2, but that was purely because I didn''t see the face until this time around.  Had I revoted, however, it would have been a 4-5.  Mainly the NI look kills the shot.  You didn''t mention the processing, but if you used Neat Image, that''s your culprit.', '2007-02-12 14:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
