(3358534, 463599, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by levyj413:</b></div><hr/><i>Oh!  Just got it (I think).  It''s a lamp, talking to the sun, almost like it''s the lamp''s god.  Wow, what a concept - I went deeper than posthumous. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, I got all that. To go deeper than posthumous, you must work the garbage can into your allegory. Good luck! :D</td>', 'Originally posted by levyj413:Oh!  Just got it (I think).  It''s a lamp, talking to the sun, almost like it''s the lamp''s god.  Wow, what a concept - I went deeper than posthumous. ;)   No, I got all that. To go deeper than posthumous, you must work the garbage can into your allegory. Good luck! :D', '2007-02-12 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 0),
