(3358940, 463990, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think the concept is very nice but you''re right, a lot of the sharpness is gone. I''m not that technically oriented so I can''t help you explain it but keep going with the good ideas.</td>', 'I think the concept is very nice but you''re right, a lot of the sharpness is gone. I''m not that technically oriented so I can''t help you explain it but keep going with the good ideas.', '2007-02-12 20:48:41.000000', NULL, 0),
