(3359003, 461343, 56002, '<td valign="top">I have been trying to express myself in regards to this, but I don''t have anything useful to say.  ''I like it very much'' will simply have to do.  Cheers!</td>', 'I have been trying to express myself in regards to this, but I don''t have anything useful to say.  ''I like it very much'' will simply have to do.  Cheers!', '2007-02-12 21:16:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3359110, 463963, 48560, '<td valign="top">i kinda like this, the idea is interesting :) <br/>i''d prefer to see a camera attached to both tripods for more "personification" effect, but that''s just me. good work on this one - i like the tilt of the head as if the dad is looking at the child.<br/> <br/>crayon</td>', 'i kinda like this, the idea is interesting :) i''d prefer to see a camera attached to both tripods for more "personification" effect, but that''s just me. good work on this one - i like the tilt of the head as if the dad is looking at the child. crayon', '2007-02-12 21:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
