(3359598, 464057, 45519, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favs (gave it a 9); a creative twist on what was destine to be a cliche image for the second go ''round of Personification (there were a ton of outlet/socket shots in Personification I).  Nicely done and congrats on an HM finish.</td>', 'This was one of my favs (gave it a 9); a creative twist on what was destine to be a cliche image for the second go ''round of Personification (there were a ton of outlet/socket shots in Personification I).  Nicely done and congrats on an HM finish.', '2007-02-13 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3359614, 461343, 45519, '<td valign="top">Amazing this isn''t a reflection ... and an outstanding image in general.  I didn''t score it terribly well (5) since it didn''t emote ''personification'' to me (I still don''t see the tie-in; an EKG-like image doesn''t = human emotion or form IMO) but it is a captivating shot and deserves kudos for being captured.  Congrats on the Top 10 placing.</td>', 'Amazing this isn''t a reflection ... and an outstanding image in general.  I didn''t score it terribly well (5) since it didn''t emote ''personification'' to me (I still don''t see the tie-in; an EKG-like image doesn''t = human emotion or form IMO) but it is a captivating shot and deserves kudos for being captured.  Congrats on the Top 10 placing.', '2007-02-13 00:09:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3359654, 463637, 62318, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this picture, I thought it was Virgin Mary holding little baby Jesus. Oh well. I like your interpretation. Wondeful lines and colors. Good focus. But really it is the two purple lines that really work for me.</td>', 'When I first saw this picture, I thought it was Virgin Mary holding little baby Jesus. Oh well. I like your interpretation. Wondeful lines and colors. Good focus. But really it is the two purple lines that really work for me.', '2007-02-13 00:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
