(3360263, 462174, 48954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvlindalou:</b></div><hr/><i> sorry....DNMC....IMO...I do like your lighting </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What in god''s name do you mean DNMC? It''s flowers that look like people and are dancing LIKE people. Honestly, take more than half a seconds to look at the picture.<br/> <br/>Very cool shot. It makes me think of Fantasia when the mushrooms start dancing to Tchaikovsky is it? Good work</td>', 'Originally posted by bvlindalou: sorry....DNMC....IMO...I do like your lighting   What in god''s name do you mean DNMC? It''s flowers that look like people and are dancing LIKE people. Honestly, take more than half a seconds to look at the picture. Very cool shot. It makes me think of Fantasia when the mushrooms start dancing to Tchaikovsky is it? Good work', '2007-02-13 07:16:39.000000', NULL, 0),
