(3360549, 463909, 65886, '<td valign="top">yes:) he has ears and he is absolutely cute, I love his expression!<br/>he is probably some hundreds of years old but still looks at the world with much interest, there is some wonder and excitement in his eyes! he chose an ineresting place to watch people and destiny.<br/>excellent mood!</td>', 'yes:) he has ears and he is absolutely cute, I love his expression!he is probably some hundreds of years old but still looks at the world with much interest, there is some wonder and excitement in his eyes! he chose an ineresting place to watch people and destiny.excellent mood!', '2007-02-13 09:33:22.000000', NULL, 0),
