(3360797, 463549, 61299, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! as a librarian, I really approve of bringing books to life - great concept :)</td>', 'Congratulations! as a librarian, I really approve of bringing books to life - great concept :)', '2007-02-13 11:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3360941, 463536, 22748, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous image! It is so real and surreal at the same time. The lighting is gorgeous and evokes a feeling of the golden light of morning drawing the giants toward the source. The wide angle and careful framing of your composition gives the image a dynamic feel, as if you can actually feel the buildings moving toward the light. I would love to hang this on my wall. It is one of the most beautiful images I''ve seen.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous image! It is so real and surreal at the same time. The lighting is gorgeous and evokes a feeling of the golden light of morning drawing the giants toward the source. The wide angle and careful framing of your composition gives the image a dynamic feel, as if you can actually feel the buildings moving toward the light. I would love to hang this on my wall. It is one of the most beautiful images I''ve seen.', '2007-02-13 12:19:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3360988, 463545, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very humorous.  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Very humorous.  Nice take on the challenge.', '2007-02-13 12:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
