(3362030, 463599, 68388, '<td valign="top"><i>Originally posted by levyj413:<br/> <br/>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>Oh! Just got it (I think). It''s a lamp, talking to the sun, almost like it''s the lamp''s god. Wow, what a concept - I went deeper than posthumous. ;)</i> <br/> <br/>Oh, I thought the lamp was telling the sun a joke and the trash can was laugh out loud.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-13 18:53:24.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by levyj413: --------------------------------------------------------------------------------Oh! Just got it (I think). It''s a lamp, talking to the sun, almost like it''s the lamp''s god. Wow, what a concept - I went deeper than posthumous. ;)  Oh, I thought the lamp was telling the sun a joke and the trash can was laugh out loud.', '2007-02-13 18:53:01.000000', '2007-02-13 18:53:24.000000', 0),
