(3366580, 463682, 58728, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot. I had given it an 8.  Usually i don''t find stuffed animal shots very appealing, but this was done so creatively...especially the lighting.  He is most definitely basking in the sun.  His position is so cute, and the windowsill gives the perfect half frame for the composition.  Great shot girl.  :)</td>', 'I loved this shot. I had given it an 8.  Usually i don''t find stuffed animal shots very appealing, but this was done so creatively...especially the lighting.  He is most definitely basking in the sun.  His position is so cute, and the windowsill gives the perfect half frame for the composition.  Great shot girl.  :)', '2007-02-14 16:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
