(3375385, 462953, 69121, '<td valign="top"><b>Critique Club Comment</b> <br/> <br/>I think this is a really good idea. It reminds me of the Dr. Seuss book titled <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Sneetches_and_Other_Stories" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Sneetches</a>. However I do not believe that I would have considered this well fitting with the challenge topic had I not read your comments on the photo. Most people expect an object showing personification to have a face or the same figure/shape as our bodies do.<br/> <br/>I really like your use of a shallow depth-of-field but would prefer it just a little less shallow. It could possibly look better if the white marbles were in the upper left corner to be even further from the green marble. I think it would also be interesting to see it from the white marbles'' perspective with the green marble off in the distance.</td>', 'Critique Club Comment  I think this is a really good idea. It reminds me of the Dr. Seuss book titled The Sneetches. However I do not believe that I would have considered this well fitting with the challenge topic had I not read your comments on the photo. Most people expect an object showing personification to have a face or the same figure/shape as our bodies do. I really like your use of a shallow depth-of-field but would prefer it just a little less shallow. It could possibly look better if the white marbles were in the upper left corner to be even further from the green marble. I think it would also be interesting to see it from the white marbles'' perspective with the green marble off in the distance.', '2007-02-17 13:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3375572, 461343, 26464, '<td valign="top">love this, perfect title. life patterns, rise and fall, do follow heartbeats. well captured. <br/></td>', 'love this, perfect title. life patterns, rise and fall, do follow heartbeats. well captured. ', '2007-02-17 15:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
