(4139229, 464057, 43463, '<td valign="top">It is amazing what one can do with just an everyday ordinary object. You took a simple electrical outlet and turned it into a extra-ordinary object that ''sheds'' emotion! Lighting in your shot is fabulous for not only do you effectively illuminate the outlet but there is a wonderful gleam to that ''teardrop''. The shape of the ''tear'' is perfectly pear-shaped and it glistens from that ''eyeduct''. Love the title too! A double pun on this everyday outlet and that of an emotional outlet.</td>', 'It is amazing what one can do with just an everyday ordinary object. You took a simple electrical outlet and turned it into a extra-ordinary object that ''sheds'' emotion! Lighting in your shot is fabulous for not only do you effectively illuminate the outlet but there is a wonderful gleam to that ''teardrop''. The shape of the ''tear'' is perfectly pear-shaped and it glistens from that ''eyeduct''. Love the title too! A double pun on this everyday outlet and that of an emotional outlet.', '2007-10-03 22:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
